  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PivotPlusPlusDemo.Runtime::PPP_DemoStation
  <Index>k__BackingField: 6
  <Name>k__BackingField: Multiple Pivots for an Object
  _description: '1. Use the Shared Pivot controls to put the pivot exactly where you want the saved pivot to be.

    2. Click Add New Pivot at the bottom of the panel.

    3. The new pivot is created exactly where the shared pivot is.


    Note: Newly created pivot and shared pivot handles will overlap, which is why it might appear as if the button did nothing. Move the shared pivot handle, will expose the new pivot.'
