  _description: '1) Click inside the Scene view to focus it.

    2) Press the Tilde (<b>`</b>) key (above Tab) to open the Overlays menu.

    3) Enable Pivot++ under the Custom foldout.

    4) Drag the overlay somewhere comfortable.






    <color=orange>NEW</color>

    Pivot++ can be turned into a normal editor window, which can be docked anywhere in the editor.

    Use the button next to the On/Off toggle to switch.'
