  <Index>k__BackingField: 0
  <Name>k__BackingField: 'Before: Unity Default Handles'
  _description: 'The door panel is selected, but its pivot sits in the middle of the panel. Rotating it swings the door around its centre instead of its hinge.

    Try it: press E for the Rotate tool and turn the door. Notice how it pulls away from the frame.

    The usual workaround is to nest the door under an empty parent placed at the hinge. Pivot++ removes that step.'
