  <Name>k__BackingField: Unbounded Offsets
  _description: 'Unbounded Offsets place the pivot at an exact distance in the object''s local space. This allows you to place the pivot outside the object''s bounds.


    The Use Object Scale toggle decides whether that offset scales with the object. Leave it on to keep the pivot in the same relative spot on differently scaled objects; turn it off to hold an exact distance regardless of scale.'
