  <Index>k__BackingField: 7
  <Name>k__BackingField: Create Parent at Pivot
  _description: 'The shared pivot is already placed on this door''s hinge edge. Click Create Parent at Pivot and Pivot++ inserts an empty parent at that spot, with the door reparented under it.


    You can use the new parent, when you want to access the offsetted pivot in the script.


    In Edit Object Pivot Mode, every saved pivot gets its own (+) button that does the same thing for that pivot'
  _isNewInV11: 1
